-------------------------------------
Challenges & Resolutions
-------------------------------------

Challenge 1: uv.lock not found during Docker build
             Problem: CI/CD pipeline failed with `uv.lock: not found` error.
             Root Cause: The file was deleted during repo cleanup and not tracked by git.
             Resolution: Force-added uv.lock and pyproject.toml back to git and set Docker
             build context to project root instead of ./backend directory.

Challenge 2: Docker image name with uppercase letters
             Problem: ghcr.io rejected image push — `8Byte-assignment` has uppercase letters.
             Root Cause: Container registries only accept lowercase image names.
             Resolution: Hardcoded lowercase image name `8byte-assignment` in cd.yml.

Challenge 3: Wrong compose file picked up
             Problem:  Running `docker compose up` in monitoring/ picked up root compose.yml.
             Root Cause:   Docker Compose searches parent directories for compose files.
             Resolution:   Always specify file explicitly: `docker compose -f docker-compose.yml up`

Challenge 4: cAdvisor no data on Mac
             Problem: cAdvisor showed no container metrics in Grafana.
             Root Cause: cAdvisor requires Linux kernel files not available on macOS Docker Desktop.
             Resolution: Created a custom Prometheus dashboard with node-exporter metrics
             which work correctly on Mac. In production on EC2 (Linux), cAdvisor works fully.

Challenge 5: Branch name mismatch
             Problem: Pipeline not triggering — repo was on `master` branch, pipelines set for `main`.
             Root Cause: Original template used `master` as default branch.
             Resolution: Renamed branch with `git branch -m master main` and updated GitHub default.

Challenge 6: Slack webhook placeholder
             Problem: Pipeline failing at Slack notification step with 405 error.
             Root Cause: Placeholder URL `https://placeholder.com` used instead of real webhook.
             Resolution: Removed Slack notification steps to keep pipeline clean.
             In production, a real Slack webhook URL would be configured.